984 (ii) to the Division of Finance for purposes of the Division of Finance administering Subsection
59-5-202(5).
986 [(ff)] (gg) Notwithstanding Subsection (2), the commission may provide the Department of Agriculture
and Food with information from a return filed in accordance with Chapter 31, Cannabinoid
